$ whycant --pid 812 read /srv/app/config/db.yml

✗ nginx (pid 812, www-data, uid 33) cannot read /srv/app/config/db.yml

  /                        drwxr-xr-x  root:root      ✓ traverse
  /srv                     drwxr-xr-x  root:root      ✓ traverse
  /srv/app                 drwxr-x---  deploy:deploy  ✗ traverse   ← blocked here
  /srv/app/config          ·           not evaluated
  /srv/app/config/db.yml   ·           not evaluated

Why
  www-data was added to group "deploy", which would allow this, but the process started
  before that and does not have the group yet. Group changes only apply to new
  sessions and restarted services; restart it.

Fixes (safest first)
  1. Restart the process so it picks up its new groups.
  2. Grant traverse only to www-data via ACL:
       sudo setfacl -m u:www-data:x /srv/app
